    {
        "content": "<p>Make your own mutual?</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">syntax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"mutual\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ppDedent</span><span class=\"o\">((</span><span class=\"n\">ppLine</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"sdef \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ident</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ident</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">unicode</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\" → \"</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\" -&gt; \"</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">term</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ppLine</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"end\"</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">command</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">macro_rules</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"kn\">mutual</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">sdef</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">names</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">ts</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">end</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cmds</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">names</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mapM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">declare_syntax_cat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">ident</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mutualDecl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"kn\">mutual</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">names</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">ident</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">ident</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">ts</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">term</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"bp\">*</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"kn\">end</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cmds</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cmds</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">push</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mutualDecl</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mkNullNode</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cmds</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">mutual</span>\n<span class=\"n\">sdef</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">then</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">))</span>\n<span class=\"n\">sdef</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">then</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">))</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">end</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
